{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Q6SSZ1r2dHMuqnH6onSXEu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 的三条 claims 都无法原样保留。从 \"general method paper\" 转为\n  \"empirical analysis paper with method contribution\"。新核心叙事：Per-head KV cache\n  sensitivity is architecture-dependent — 我们提供首个跨模型族系统刻画，揭示\n  compounding effects 与 GQA ratio 相关，并表明 constrained discrete optimization\n  是必要的但最优 constraints 是 model-specific 的。Qwen 结果作为 strong positive\n  case study 而非 general claim；跨模型差异本身作为 empirical finding；\n  强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility 而非 specific constraint 的 universality。\n  仍冲 EMNLP Main，positioning 从 \"efficient method\" 转向\n  \"empirical analysis + practical framework\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No L0 Exclusion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      去掉 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，观察 solver 是否仍从 profiling\n      数据自动将 Layer 0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_no_l0excl_ppl_wikitext: 17.2\n      qwen_baseline_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      ppl_degradation_vs_constrained_pct: 53.2\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 0\n      l0_heads_assigned_4bit: 5\n      l0_heads_assigned_2bit: 2\n      solver_auto_discovers_l0: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Profiler 在 per-head independent 测量下，L0 heads 的 delta 虽然绝对值最高，\n      但在 MCKP budget 竞争中，solver 倾向于将 8-bit 预算分配给中层若干\n      high-delta heads（它们的 delta-per-bit-cost ratio 更优）。L0 的关键性来自\n      其与后续层的 compounding interaction，而非 independent delta 本身。\n      去掉显式 L0 exclusion 后，solver 将 L0 部分 heads 降至 4-bit 甚至 2-bit，\n      触发严重的 compounding 劣化。PPL 从 11.23 恶化到 ~17.2（+53%），\n      远超 10% 阈值。这证明 profiler 信号不足以自动发现 L0 的特殊地位，\n      L0 exclusion 本质上是 domain knowledge injection 而非 data-driven discovery。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"L0 Exclusion Ablation\"\n        columns: [config, l0_bitwidth, ppl_wikitext, delta_vs_constrained]\n        rows:\n          - [constrained_with_l0excl, \"8-bit (forced)\", 11.23, \"baseline\"]\n          - [no_l0excl_max2bit8, \"mixed 4/2-bit (solver)\", 17.2, \"+53.2%\"]\n          - [uniform_4bit, \"4-bit\", 15.45, \"+37.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PPL comparison across three configs. no_l0excl 比 uniform 4-bit 还差，说明 solver 在无 L0 保护时做出了比均匀分配更糟的选择。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Solver 不仅未发现 L0，反而因 budget 优化将 L0 降级，结果比 uniform 更差。\n      这说明 \"automatic discovery\" claim 不成立——L0 protection 是 necessary\n      prior knowledge。在 reframed narrative 中，这反而强化了 \"constraints as\n      regularization\" 的论点：正确的 constraint 需要 model-specific knowledge，\n      而非纯数据驱动。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1) 上复现完整 pipeline：profile → constrained MCKP → eval。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.95\n      llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 8.31\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: 7.2\n      llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 9.83\n      llama_l0_delta_rank: \"not dominant (rank 12-18 among 32 layers)\"\n      llama_num_heads_determining_70pct_degradation: \"~15% of heads (vs Qwen 3.6%)\"\n      llama_compounding_severity: \"mild\"\n      llama_optimal_max2bit: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 的 GQA ratio 4:1（每层 8 KV heads，共 256 heads）使得 sensitivity\n      分布比 Qwen (GQA 7:1, 每层 4 KV heads, 共 112 heads) 更均匀。更多的 KV heads\n      意味着每个 head 承载更少的信息量，individual head 的 failure 影响更小。\n      L0 不再是 dominant sensitivity source——sensitivity 分散在多个层的多个 heads 上。\n      Constrained MCKP 仍优于 uniform（7.2%），但远低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      因为 head heterogeneity 本身更低。Unconstrained MCKP 的 PPL（9.83）虽差于\n      constrained 但并未 catastrophic failure（对比 Qwen 的 36.92），\n      因为 compounding effect 在 GQA 4:1 下更温和——更多 heads 分担了\n      extreme quantization 的 joint distortion。这削弱了 \"compounding is universal\n      and catastrophic\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [method, ppl_wikitext, compression, improvement_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_4bit, 8.95, \"4×\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 8.31, \"4×\", \"7.2%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 9.83, \"4×\", \"-9.8% (worse than uniform)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap (32 layers × 8 heads): 相比 Qwen 的 L0 spike pattern，Llama 呈现更均匀的分布，peak sensitivity 分散在 L0-L3 和 L28-L31。\"\n      - \"Sensitivity CDF: Llama 需要 ~15% 的 heads 才覆盖 70% degradation，Qwen 仅需 3.6%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7.2% 改进虽然 positive 但 marginal——reviewer 会质疑是否 justifies method\n      complexity。Unconstrained 未 catastrophic failure 意味着 Llama 上\n      cardinality constraint 的 motivation 更弱。核心发现：GQA ratio 越低，\n      sensitivity 越分散，constrained MCKP 的边际收益越小。\n      这支持 \"sensitivity structure is architecture-dependent\" 的 reframed narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline，建立跨架构有效性。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.42\n      mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 7.93\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: 5.8\n      mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 8.71\n      mistral_l0_delta_rank: \"rank 5-8 among 32 layers\"\n      mistral_sliding_window_complication: true\n      mistral_optimal_max2bit: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral 同样是 GQA 4:1（与 Llama 相同），但 sliding window attention\n      改变了 KV cache 的 usage pattern——早期 token 的 KV 被 evict，使得\n      对 precision 的依赖模式不同。Sensitivity 分布更接近 Llama（分散型），\n      但 sliding window 还引入了 position-dependent sensitivity 的额外复杂度，\n      我们的 position-agnostic profiler 无法捕获。改进幅度 5.8% 进一步确认\n      低 GQA ratio 下 method 边际收益有限。Unconstrained MCKP PPL 8.71\n      仅比 uniform 差 3.4%——完全没有 catastrophic failure，\n      进一步削弱 compounding 的 universal catastrophic 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Mistral-7B Results\"\n        columns: [method, ppl_wikitext, compression, improvement_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_4bit, 8.42, \"4×\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 7.93, \"4×\", \"5.8%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 8.71, \"4×\", \"-3.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap: 类似 Llama 的分散模式，但 sliding window 导致后半层 sensitivity 整体偏高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral 的 5.8% 改进是三个模型中最低的。Sliding window attention 使得\n      我们的 static profiling 假设部分失效。与 Llama 结果联合看，\n      GQA 4:1 模型上 constrained MCKP 的 value proposition 弱于 GQA 7:1。\n      但这正是 reframed narrative 的核心 finding：GQA ratio 决定了\n      head sensitivity 的集中度，进而决定了 per-head allocation 的收益空间。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Sweep (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit from 0 to 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve，\n      刻画 compounding threshold。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_compounding_curve:\n        max2bit_0: 11.89\n        max2bit_4: 11.45\n        max2bit_8: 11.23\n        max2bit_16: 11.31\n        max2bit_24: 12.05\n        max2bit_48: 15.78\n        max2bit_75: 24.31\n        max2bit_112: 36.92\n      elbow_k_qwen: 8\n      curve_shape: \"hockey stick with clear elbow at k=8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen 的 GQA 7:1 产生少量（112 个）但每个 information-dense 的 KV heads。\n      当少量 heads 被极端量化时，joint distortion 仍可控（k≤8 时 PPL 平稳），\n      但超过阈值后 compounding 急剧恶化——因为 dense heads 之间的 interaction\n      在 extreme quantization 下是超线性的。k=8 处有清晰 elbow。\n      这个 curve 在 Qwen 上非常漂亮，是 paper 的核心 figure 之一。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [max_2bit_k, ppl_wikitext, num_heads_at_2bit_actual, delta_vs_k8]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 11.89, 0, \"+5.9%\"]\n          - [4, 11.45, 4, \"+2.0%\"]\n          - [8, 11.23, 8, \"baseline\"]\n          - [16, 11.31, 16, \"+0.7%\"]\n          - [24, 12.05, 24, \"+7.3%\"]\n          - [48, 15.78, 44, \"+40.5%\"]\n          - [75, 24.31, 68, \"+116.6%\"]\n          - [112, 36.92, 95, \"+228.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs max_2bit curve (hockey stick): x 轴 max_2bit k, y 轴 WikiText-2 PPL. 清晰 elbow at k=8. Annotate optimal zone k∈[4,16].\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 上 compounding curve 有教科书般清晰的 elbow，但问题在于\n      这种 pattern 是否跨模型复现——在 worst 档下，Llama 和 Mistral\n      上该 curve 预计平坦或无 elbow（见 plan_002/003 的 unconstrained 结果）。\n      Reframed narrative 将此作为 \"GQA-ratio-dependent compounding\"\n      的 case study 而非 universal phenomenon。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 2×, 4×, 8× 压缩率下的表现，\n      与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_2x_uniform_ppl: 7.82\n      qwen_2x_constrained_ppl: 7.45\n      qwen_2x_improvement_pct: 4.7\n      qwen_4x_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n      qwen_4x_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      qwen_4x_improvement_pct: 27.3\n      qwen_8x_uniform_ppl: 89.4\n      qwen_8x_constrained_ppl: 42.6\n      qwen_8x_improvement_pct: 52.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      2× 压缩下 budget 充裕（平均 8-bit），大部分 heads 已在安全区间，\n      per-head optimization 的空间有限（4.7%）。4× 是 sweet spot（27.3%），\n      与已有 MVP 结果一致。8× 极端压缩下，constrained MCKP 改进幅度最大\n      （52.3%）但绝对 PPL 仍然很高（42.6），因为 budget 不足以保护\n      所有 critical heads——即使最优分配也无法避免严重质量损失。\n      这些数字都是 Qwen-specific 的，鉴于 Llama/Mistral 在 4× 时\n      仅有 5-7% 改进，它们在 2× 和 8× 下的改进预计更小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [compression, uniform_ppl, constrained_ppl, improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 7.82, 7.45, \"4.7%\"]\n          - [\"4×\", 15.45, 11.23, \"27.3%\"]\n          - [\"8×\", 89.4, 42.6, \"52.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: uniform vs constrained PPL at each compression ratio. 4× 是 narrative sweet spot。\"\n      - \"Line plot: improvement % vs compression ratio. 随压缩率增加收益增大，但绝对 PPL 也恶化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sweep 在 Qwen 上 works well，但 reviewer 会要求看\n      Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep——在 worst 档下这些预计仅有\n      2-5% 改进空间，弱化 method 的 general value proposition。\n      Reframe: 强调 per-head allocation 在高压缩率下更 critical，\n      且 benefit 与 architecture 的 sensitivity concentration 正相关。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs 当前 16×512）做高分辨率 profiling，\n      重跑 MCKP，测试是否发现 mid-layer heterogeneity 并改善分配。\n    expected_results:\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 31\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16\n      hires_constrained_ppl: 11.09\n      lores_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      hires_improvement_over_lores_pct: 1.2\n      hires_new_midlayer_discoveries: 3\n      hires_profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      高分辨率 profiling 将 nonzero-delta heads 从 16% 提升到 31%，\n      确实发现了几个 mid-layer heads 有 measurable sensitivity。\n      但这些 newly-discovered heads 的 delta 仅占 total distortion 的 ~3%，\n      对 MCKP allocation 几乎无影响——solver 仍然做出几乎相同的分配决策。\n      PPL 仅从 11.23 降至 11.09（1.2% 改善），不足以 justify 4× 的\n      profiling compute overhead。根本原因：在 2-bit 分辨率下，\n      大部分 mid-layer heads 确实 insensitive（这是真信号而非\n      measurement noise），profiler resolution 不是 bottleneck，\n      head sensitivity 的 long-tail distribution 本身是 fundamental。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [resolution, nonzero_head_pct, constrained_ppl, profiling_hours]\n        rows:\n          - [\"16×512 (lores)\", \"16%\", 11.23, 0.7]\n          - [\"64×2048 (hires)\", \"31%\", 11.09, 2.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Delta heatmap comparison: lores vs hires. Hires 在 mid-layers 多出几个非零点，但量级很小。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: lores delta vs hires delta per head. 高相关 (r>0.95)，说明 lores 已足够。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Hires profiling 是 negative result：profiler resolution 并非\n      fundamental limitation，sensitivity 的 sparse 分布本身是\n      architecture 的 intrinsic property。这其实是 informative negative——\n      说明 16×512 已经是 cost-effective 的 profiling budget。\n      但无法 claim \"better profiling → better allocation\"。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit，\n      测试结果是否 WikiText-2 specific。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_uniform4bit_ppl: 18.73\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl: 16.92\n      c4_improvement_pct: 9.7\n      c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: 0.58\n      c4_allocation_agreement_pct: 72\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 是更多样化的 web corpus，分布与 WikiText-2 有显著差异。\n      Per-head sensitivity 在 C4 上的排序与 WikiText-2 仅有中等相关\n      (rank corr 0.58)，因为不同 domain 的 text 激活不同 heads。\n      改进幅度从 27% 降至 9.7%——仍 positive 但显著缩水。\n      Allocation agreement 72% 意味着 ~28% 的 heads 在两个 dataset\n      上被分配了不同的 bit-width，暗示 optimal allocation 是\n      distribution-dependent 的。这弱化了 \"one-shot profiling\"\n      的实用性叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C4 Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [dataset, uniform_ppl, constrained_ppl, improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [WikiText-2, 15.45, 11.23, \"27.3%\"]\n          - [C4, 18.73, 16.92, \"9.7%\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Dataset Allocation Agreement\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [rank_correlation, 0.58]\n          - [allocation_agreement, \"72%\"]\n          - [l0_protection_consistent, \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: per-head delta (WikiText-2) vs per-head delta (C4). 中等相关，visible outliers in mid-layers.\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 上 9.7% 改进刚好低于 10% 的 \"显著\" 阈值（在 worst 定义中）。\n      Rank correlation 0.58 处于 worst 范围内 [0.45, 0.7]。\n      这意味着 profiling 的 calibration data 选择 matters——\n      reviewer 会问 \"which calibration set should a practitioner use?\"\n      Reframe: 承认 allocation 是 partially distribution-dependent，\n      但 L0 protection 是 robust across datasets。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Comparison (Reverse Waterfilling)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在离散 action set 上的版本，\n      与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_waterfilling_ppl: 8.52\n      llama_constrained_ppl: 8.31\n      llama_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap: 2.5\n      qwen_waterfilling_ppl: 12.87\n      qwen_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      qwen_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap: 14.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Reverse waterfilling 本质上是 continuous relaxation + rounding，\n      在 Llama 这种 sensitivity 分散的模型上，rounding error 较小\n      （因为 head 之间 delta 差异小，rounding 方向影响有限），\n      所以 waterfilling 与 MCKP 差距仅 2.5%。在 Qwen 上差距更大\n      （14.6%），因为 L0 的 extreme sensitivity 导致 rounding 在\n      critical head 上犯错——但这个差距比 constrained vs unconstrained\n      的差距（11.23 vs 36.92）小得多，reviewer 可能认为\n      waterfilling + L0 heuristic 就足够了，不需要完整 MCKP machinery。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Waterfilling vs MCKP\"\n        columns: [model, waterfilling_ppl, constrained_mckp_ppl, gap_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 12.87, 11.23, \"14.6%\"]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8.52, 8.31, \"2.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: waterfilling vs MCKP across models. Qwen 差距明显，Llama 差距 marginal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 Llama 上 waterfilling 与 MCKP 几乎等效（2.5% gap），\n      削弱了 \"discrete MCKP is fundamentally necessary\" 的 claim。\n      Reviewer 会问：如果只在 GQA 7:1 模型上 MCKP 明显优于 waterfilling，\n      那这是 method contribution 还是 Qwen-specific trick？\n      Reframe: 强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility（能自然嵌入\n      cardinality constraint，waterfilling 不行）。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Brute-Force Subset)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen 的 3-4 layer groups 上做 brute-force 穷举最优分配，\n      量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的差距。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_subset_ppl: 10.41\n      mckp_subset_ppl: 10.78\n      mckp_to_oracle_gap_pct: 3.6\n      oracle_allocation_agrees_with_mckp_pct: 81\n    result_rationale: >\n      在小规模子集上，brute-force oracle 能利用 joint evaluation\n      捕捉 compounding interaction，找到 MCKP additive assumption\n      遗漏的 inter-head synergies。3.6% 的 gap 说明 MCKP 虽然\n      near-optimal 但并非 optimal——additive distortion model\n      即使加了 cardinality constraint 也有 residual error。\n      在 worst 档下，这个 gap 比预期大（理想情况应 <2%），\n      暗示 compounding 的 non-additivity 比 cardinality constraint\n      能 capture 的更复杂（涉及 specific head combinations，\n      不仅仅是 count）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset, Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [method, subset_ppl, gap_to_oracle]\n        rows:\n          - [brute_force_oracle, 10.41, \"0%\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 10.78, \"3.6%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 14.93, \"43.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Allocation diff heatmap: oracle vs MCKP on subset layers. ~19% heads 被不同分配。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.6% gap 虽然不大但 non-trivial。在 reframed narrative 中，\n      这是 honest limitation：cardinality constraint 是 first-order\n      approximation，full interaction structure 需要更复杂的\n      constraint 设计或 iterative profiling。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      用 C4 calibrate、WikiText-2 evaluate（及反向），报告 per-head\n      allocation 跨 calibration source 的一致率。\n    expected_results:\n      calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl: 12.14\n      calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.23\n      calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl: 16.92\n      calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl: 17.85\n      cross_calib_allocation_agreement_pct: 68\n      l0_robust_across_calib: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration data 影响 per-head delta 估计。C4 calibration 在\n      WikiText-2 上评估时 PPL 12.14（vs 同 domain 的 11.23），\n      degradation 8.1%。反向（wiki calib → C4 eval）degradation 5.5%。\n      Allocation agreement 68% 低于理想（>85%），说明约 1/3 的 heads\n      的最优 bit-width 是 distribution-dependent。\n      L0 protection 跨 calibration 一致（因为 L0 在任何 distribution 上\n      都是 dominant），但 mid-layer 分配不稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Calibration Results (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [calibration, eval_dataset, ppl, vs_matched_calib]\n        rows:\n          - [WikiText-2, WikiText-2, 11.23, \"baseline\"]\n          - [C4, WikiText-2, 12.14, \"+8.1%\"]\n          - [C4, C4, 16.92, \"baseline\"]\n          - [WikiText-2, C4, 17.85, \"+5.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap diff: C4-calibrated vs Wiki-calibrated allocation. 差异集中在 mid-layers。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration degradation 是 real concern。Practitioner 需要\n      选择与 deployment distribution 匹配的 calibration data。\n      在 reframed narrative 中，这是 practical limitation 的\n      honest characterization，也是 future work direction。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成 paper-quality figures：per-head delta heatmap、compounding curve、\n      budget allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      key_visual_finding: \"cross-model heatmap comparison dramatically shows architecture-dependent sensitivity\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Visualization 本身不产生新数据，但在 worst 档下，cross-model\n      heatmap 成为 paper 最重要的 figure——直观展示 Qwen (concentrated,\n      L0-dominant) vs Llama/Mistral (dispersed, no single dominant layer)\n      的对比。Compounding curve 只在 Qwen 上有 dramatic elbow，\n      Llama/Mistral 的 curve 相对平坦。这些 visual 恰好 serve\n      reframed narrative。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: 三模型 per-head delta heatmap 横向对比 (3 panels). Qwen 的 L0 spike 非常醒目，Llama/Mistral 分散。\"\n      - \"Figure 2: Compounding effect curves (3 lines on same plot). Qwen hockey stick, Llama/Mistral 近似线性。\"\n      - \"Figure 3: Budget allocation Sankey diagram — bits flow from budget to layers to heads。\"\n      - \"Figure 4: GQA ratio vs sensitivity concentration scatter (3 data points + trend).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Visualization 在 worst 档下反而更有 impact，因为跨模型差异\n      本身就是 visually striking finding。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU/LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下跑 MMLU 和 LongBench，测试 PPL 改进\n      是否 translate to downstream performance。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_fp16_mmlu: 68.2\n      qwen_uniform4bit_mmlu: 64.1\n      qwen_constrained_mmlu: 65.8\n      qwen_mmlu_recovery_pct: 41.5\n      qwen_fp16_longbench_avg: 45.3\n      qwen_uniform4bit_longbench_avg: 38.7\n      qwen_constrained_longbench_avg: 41.2\n      qwen_longbench_recovery_pct: 37.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改进（27%）不会线性 translate 到 downstream tasks。\n      MMLU 是 knowledge-intensive 的 multiple-choice task，\n      quantization 主要影响 calibration（logit precision）而非\n      knowledge recall，所以 recovery 有限（41.5%）。\n      LongBench 涉及 long context，KV cache quantization 对\n      long-range attention 的影响更大，但 constrained MCKP 的\n      per-head allocation 在 long context 下的 optimality\n      可能不同于 short context（profiling 用 2048 tokens），\n      导致 recovery 更低（37.9%）。整体 downstream improvement\n      存在但 modest，不足以成为独立 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Downstream Performance (Qwen2.5-7B, 4×)\"\n        columns: [task, fp16, uniform_4bit, constrained_mckp, recovery_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 68.2, 64.1, 65.8, \"41.5%\"]\n          - [LongBench_avg, 45.3, 38.7, 41.2, \"37.9%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: FP16 / uniform / constrained on MMLU and LongBench.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream results 是 positive but modest。在 worst 档下\n      不足以作为 strong selling point。建议在 paper 中放为\n      supplementary experiment，主叙事仍以 PPL 为核心 metric，\n      downstream 作为 sanity check。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only (Qwen2.5-72B)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上只跑 distortion profiling（不做完整 eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen72b_l0_dominance: true\n      qwen72b_l0_delta_ratio_vs_avg: \"~60× (vs 7B 的 100×)\"\n      qwen72b_nonzero_head_pct: 22\n      qwen72b_sensitivity_concentration: \"5.1% heads cover 70% degradation\"\n      qwen72b_gqa_ratio: \"7:1 (same as 7B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 与 7B 共享 GQA 7:1 架构，所以 L0 dominance 保持（支持\n      GQA-ratio-dependent hypothesis）。但 72B 有 80 layers vs 7B 的 28，\n      更多层分摊了 sensitivity，L0 的 relative dominance 降低\n      （60× vs 100×）。Nonzero head pct 22% 略高于 7B 的 16%，\n      因为更深的 model 有更多层的 heads 对 quantization 有\n      non-trivial sensitivity。但 concentration 仍然高（5.1%），\n      确认 GQA 7:1 架构的 sensitivity 集中特性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Scale Comparison (Qwen Family)\"\n        columns: [model, layers, kv_heads, l0_delta_ratio, nonzero_pct, top_heads_for_70pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 28, 112, \"100×\", \"16%\", \"3.6%\"]\n          - [Qwen2.5-72B, 80, 320, \"60×\", \"22%\", \"5.1%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap: 72B (80×4). 与 7B 相同的 L0 spike pattern，但 relative magnitude 较小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B profiling 支持 GQA-ratio-dependent sensitivity hypothesis——\n      同 GQA ratio 的不同 model sizes 有相似但不完全相同的 pattern。\n      在 worst 档下，这是 supporting evidence for reframed narrative，\n      但不足以 claim \"method scales to 70B\" 因为我们没有做完整 eval。\n      作为 paper 的 supplementary evidence 足够。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10256,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10256},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43c262b0-4c86-40ed-a43c-7cbed76d8848","uuid":"6d8190de-a9bd-4ade-a1c3-dc55b523ff5b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":201909,"duration_api_ms":204417,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 的三条 claims 都无法原样保留。从 \"general method paper\" 转为\n  \"empirical analysis paper with method contribution\"。新核心叙事：Per-head KV cache\n  sensitivity is architecture-dependent — 我们提供首个跨模型族系统刻画，揭示\n  compounding effects 与 GQA ratio 相关，并表明 constrained discrete optimization\n  是必要的但最优 constraints 是 model-specific 的。Qwen 结果作为 strong positive\n  case study 而非 general claim；跨模型差异本身作为 empirical finding；\n  强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility 而非 specific constraint 的 universality。\n  仍冲 EMNLP Main，positioning 从 \"efficient method\" 转向\n  \"empirical analysis + practical framework\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No L0 Exclusion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      去掉 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，观察 solver 是否仍从 profiling\n      数据自动将 Layer 0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_no_l0excl_ppl_wikitext: 17.2\n      qwen_baseline_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      ppl_degradation_vs_constrained_pct: 53.2\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 0\n      l0_heads_assigned_4bit: 5\n      l0_heads_assigned_2bit: 2\n      solver_auto_discovers_l0: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Profiler 在 per-head independent 测量下，L0 heads 的 delta 虽然绝对值最高，\n      但在 MCKP budget 竞争中，solver 倾向于将 8-bit 预算分配给中层若干\n      high-delta heads（它们的 delta-per-bit-cost ratio 更优）。L0 的关键性来自\n      其与后续层的 compounding interaction，而非 independent delta 本身。\n      去掉显式 L0 exclusion 后，solver 将 L0 部分 heads 降至 4-bit 甚至 2-bit，\n      触发严重的 compounding 劣化。PPL 从 11.23 恶化到 ~17.2（+53%），\n      远超 10% 阈值。这证明 profiler 信号不足以自动发现 L0 的特殊地位，\n      L0 exclusion 本质上是 domain knowledge injection 而非 data-driven discovery。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"L0 Exclusion Ablation\"\n        columns: [config, l0_bitwidth, ppl_wikitext, delta_vs_constrained]\n        rows:\n          - [constrained_with_l0excl, \"8-bit (forced)\", 11.23, \"baseline\"]\n          - [no_l0excl_max2bit8, \"mixed 4/2-bit (solver)\", 17.2, \"+53.2%\"]\n          - [uniform_4bit, \"4-bit\", 15.45, \"+37.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PPL comparison across three configs. no_l0excl 比 uniform 4-bit 还差，说明 solver 在无 L0 保护时做出了比均匀分配更糟的选择。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Solver 不仅未发现 L0，反而因 budget 优化将 L0 降级，结果比 uniform 更差。\n      这说明 \"automatic discovery\" claim 不成立——L0 protection 是 necessary\n      prior knowledge。在 reframed narrative 中，这反而强化了 \"constraints as\n      regularization\" 的论点：正确的 constraint 需要 model-specific knowledge，\n      而非纯数据驱动。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1) 上复现完整 pipeline：profile → constrained MCKP → eval。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.95\n      llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 8.31\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: 7.2\n      llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 9.83\n      llama_l0_delta_rank: \"not dominant (rank 12-18 among 32 layers)\"\n      llama_num_heads_determining_70pct_degradation: \"~15% of heads (vs Qwen 3.6%)\"\n      llama_compounding_severity: \"mild\"\n      llama_optimal_max2bit: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 的 GQA ratio 4:1（每层 8 KV heads，共 256 heads）使得 sensitivity\n      分布比 Qwen (GQA 7:1, 每层 4 KV heads, 共 112 heads) 更均匀。更多的 KV heads\n      意味着每个 head 承载更少的信息量，individual head 的 failure 影响更小。\n      L0 不再是 dominant sensitivity source——sensitivity 分散在多个层的多个 heads 上。\n      Constrained MCKP 仍优于 uniform（7.2%），但远低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      因为 head heterogeneity 本身更低。Unconstrained MCKP 的 PPL（9.83）虽差于\n      constrained 但并未 catastrophic failure（对比 Qwen 的 36.92），\n      因为 compounding effect 在 GQA 4:1 下更温和——更多 heads 分担了\n      extreme quantization 的 joint distortion。这削弱了 \"compounding is universal\n      and catastrophic\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [method, ppl_wikitext, compression, improvement_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_4bit, 8.95, \"4×\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 8.31, \"4×\", \"7.2%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 9.83, \"4×\", \"-9.8% (worse than uniform)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap (32 layers × 8 heads): 相比 Qwen 的 L0 spike pattern，Llama 呈现更均匀的分布，peak sensitivity 分散在 L0-L3 和 L28-L31。\"\n      - \"Sensitivity CDF: Llama 需要 ~15% 的 heads 才覆盖 70% degradation，Qwen 仅需 3.6%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7.2% 改进虽然 positive 但 marginal——reviewer 会质疑是否 justifies method\n      complexity。Unconstrained 未 catastrophic failure 意味着 Llama 上\n      cardinality constraint 的 motivation 更弱。核心发现：GQA ratio 越低，\n      sensitivity 越分散，constrained MCKP 的边际收益越小。\n      这支持 \"sensitivity structure is architecture-dependent\" 的 reframed narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline，建立跨架构有效性。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.42\n      mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 7.93\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: 5.8\n      mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 8.71\n      mistral_l0_delta_rank: \"rank 5-8 among 32 layers\"\n      mistral_sliding_window_complication: true\n      mistral_optimal_max2bit: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral 同样是 GQA 4:1（与 Llama 相同），但 sliding window attention\n      改变了 KV cache 的 usage pattern——早期 token 的 KV 被 evict，使得\n      对 precision 的依赖模式不同。Sensitivity 分布更接近 Llama（分散型），\n      但 sliding window 还引入了 position-dependent sensitivity 的额外复杂度，\n      我们的 position-agnostic profiler 无法捕获。改进幅度 5.8% 进一步确认\n      低 GQA ratio 下 method 边际收益有限。Unconstrained MCKP PPL 8.71\n      仅比 uniform 差 3.4%——完全没有 catastrophic failure，\n      进一步削弱 compounding 的 universal catastrophic 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Mistral-7B Results\"\n        columns: [method, ppl_wikitext, compression, improvement_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_4bit, 8.42, \"4×\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 7.93, \"4×\", \"5.8%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 8.71, \"4×\", \"-3.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap: 类似 Llama 的分散模式，但 sliding window 导致后半层 sensitivity 整体偏高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral 的 5.8% 改进是三个模型中最低的。Sliding window attention 使得\n      我们的 static profiling 假设部分失效。与 Llama 结果联合看，\n      GQA 4:1 模型上 constrained MCKP 的 value proposition 弱于 GQA 7:1。\n      但这正是 reframed narrative 的核心 finding：GQA ratio 决定了\n      head sensitivity 的集中度，进而决定了 per-head allocation 的收益空间。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Sweep (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit from 0 to 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve，\n      刻画 compounding threshold。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_compounding_curve:\n        max2bit_0: 11.89\n        max2bit_4: 11.45\n        max2bit_8: 11.23\n        max2bit_16: 11.31\n        max2bit_24: 12.05\n        max2bit_48: 15.78\n        max2bit_75: 24.31\n        max2bit_112: 36.92\n      elbow_k_qwen: 8\n      curve_shape: \"hockey stick with clear elbow at k=8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen 的 GQA 7:1 产生少量（112 个）但每个 information-dense 的 KV heads。\n      当少量 heads 被极端量化时，joint distortion 仍可控（k≤8 时 PPL 平稳），\n      但超过阈值后 compounding 急剧恶化——因为 dense heads 之间的 interaction\n      在 extreme quantization 下是超线性的。k=8 处有清晰 elbow。\n      这个 curve 在 Qwen 上非常漂亮，是 paper 的核心 figure 之一。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [max_2bit_k, ppl_wikitext, num_heads_at_2bit_actual, delta_vs_k8]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 11.89, 0, \"+5.9%\"]\n          - [4, 11.45, 4, \"+2.0%\"]\n          - [8, 11.23, 8, \"baseline\"]\n          - [16, 11.31, 16, \"+0.7%\"]\n          - [24, 12.05, 24, \"+7.3%\"]\n          - [48, 15.78, 44, \"+40.5%\"]\n          - [75, 24.31, 68, \"+116.6%\"]\n          - [112, 36.92, 95, \"+228.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs max_2bit curve (hockey stick): x 轴 max_2bit k, y 轴 WikiText-2 PPL. 清晰 elbow at k=8. Annotate optimal zone k∈[4,16].\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 上 compounding curve 有教科书般清晰的 elbow，但问题在于\n      这种 pattern 是否跨模型复现——在 worst 档下，Llama 和 Mistral\n      上该 curve 预计平坦或无 elbow（见 plan_002/003 的 unconstrained 结果）。\n      Reframed narrative 将此作为 \"GQA-ratio-dependent compounding\"\n      的 case study 而非 universal phenomenon。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 2×, 4×, 8× 压缩率下的表现，\n      与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_2x_uniform_ppl: 7.82\n      qwen_2x_constrained_ppl: 7.45\n      qwen_2x_improvement_pct: 4.7\n      qwen_4x_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n      qwen_4x_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      qwen_4x_improvement_pct: 27.3\n      qwen_8x_uniform_ppl: 89.4\n      qwen_8x_constrained_ppl: 42.6\n      qwen_8x_improvement_pct: 52.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      2× 压缩下 budget 充裕（平均 8-bit），大部分 heads 已在安全区间，\n      per-head optimization 的空间有限（4.7%）。4× 是 sweet spot（27.3%），\n      与已有 MVP 结果一致。8× 极端压缩下，constrained MCKP 改进幅度最大\n      （52.3%）但绝对 PPL 仍然很高（42.6），因为 budget 不足以保护\n      所有 critical heads——即使最优分配也无法避免严重质量损失。\n      这些数字都是 Qwen-specific 的，鉴于 Llama/Mistral 在 4× 时\n      仅有 5-7% 改进，它们在 2× 和 8× 下的改进预计更小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [compression, uniform_ppl, constrained_ppl, improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 7.82, 7.45, \"4.7%\"]\n          - [\"4×\", 15.45, 11.23, \"27.3%\"]\n          - [\"8×\", 89.4, 42.6, \"52.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: uniform vs constrained PPL at each compression ratio. 4× 是 narrative sweet spot。\"\n      - \"Line plot: improvement % vs compression ratio. 随压缩率增加收益增大，但绝对 PPL 也恶化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sweep 在 Qwen 上 works well，但 reviewer 会要求看\n      Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep——在 worst 档下这些预计仅有\n      2-5% 改进空间，弱化 method 的 general value proposition。\n      Reframe: 强调 per-head allocation 在高压缩率下更 critical，\n      且 benefit 与 architecture 的 sensitivity concentration 正相关。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs 当前 16×512）做高分辨率 profiling，\n      重跑 MCKP，测试是否发现 mid-layer heterogeneity 并改善分配。\n    expected_results:\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 31\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16\n      hires_constrained_ppl: 11.09\n      lores_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      hires_improvement_over_lores_pct: 1.2\n      hires_new_midlayer_discoveries: 3\n      hires_profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      高分辨率 profiling 将 nonzero-delta heads 从 16% 提升到 31%，\n      确实发现了几个 mid-layer heads 有 measurable sensitivity。\n      但这些 newly-discovered heads 的 delta 仅占 total distortion 的 ~3%，\n      对 MCKP allocation 几乎无影响——solver 仍然做出几乎相同的分配决策。\n      PPL 仅从 11.23 降至 11.09（1.2% 改善），不足以 justify 4× 的\n      profiling compute overhead。根本原因：在 2-bit 分辨率下，\n      大部分 mid-layer heads 确实 insensitive（这是真信号而非\n      measurement noise），profiler resolution 不是 bottleneck，\n      head sensitivity 的 long-tail distribution 本身是 fundamental。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [resolution, nonzero_head_pct, constrained_ppl, profiling_hours]\n        rows:\n          - [\"16×512 (lores)\", \"16%\", 11.23, 0.7]\n          - [\"64×2048 (hires)\", \"31%\", 11.09, 2.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Delta heatmap comparison: lores vs hires. Hires 在 mid-layers 多出几个非零点，但量级很小。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: lores delta vs hires delta per head. 高相关 (r>0.95)，说明 lores 已足够。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Hires profiling 是 negative result：profiler resolution 并非\n      fundamental limitation，sensitivity 的 sparse 分布本身是\n      architecture 的 intrinsic property。这其实是 informative negative——\n      说明 16×512 已经是 cost-effective 的 profiling budget。\n      但无法 claim \"better profiling → better allocation\"。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit，\n      测试结果是否 WikiText-2 specific。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_uniform4bit_ppl: 18.73\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl: 16.92\n      c4_improvement_pct: 9.7\n      c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: 0.58\n      c4_allocation_agreement_pct: 72\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 是更多样化的 web corpus，分布与 WikiText-2 有显著差异。\n      Per-head sensitivity 在 C4 上的排序与 WikiText-2 仅有中等相关\n      (rank corr 0.58)，因为不同 domain 的 text 激活不同 heads。\n      改进幅度从 27% 降至 9.7%——仍 positive 但显著缩水。\n      Allocation agreement 72% 意味着 ~28% 的 heads 在两个 dataset\n      上被分配了不同的 bit-width，暗示 optimal allocation 是\n      distribution-dependent 的。这弱化了 \"one-shot profiling\"\n      的实用性叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C4 Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [dataset, uniform_ppl, constrained_ppl, improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [WikiText-2, 15.45, 11.23, \"27.3%\"]\n          - [C4, 18.73, 16.92, \"9.7%\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Dataset Allocation Agreement\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [rank_correlation, 0.58]\n          - [allocation_agreement, \"72%\"]\n          - [l0_protection_consistent, \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: per-head delta (WikiText-2) vs per-head delta (C4). 中等相关，visible outliers in mid-layers.\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 上 9.7% 改进刚好低于 10% 的 \"显著\" 阈值（在 worst 定义中）。\n      Rank correlation 0.58 处于 worst 范围内 [0.45, 0.7]。\n      这意味着 profiling 的 calibration data 选择 matters——\n      reviewer 会问 \"which calibration set should a practitioner use?\"\n      Reframe: 承认 allocation 是 partially distribution-dependent，\n      但 L0 protection 是 robust across datasets。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Comparison (Reverse Waterfilling)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在离散 action set 上的版本，\n      与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_waterfilling_ppl: 8.52\n      llama_constrained_ppl: 8.31\n      llama_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap: 2.5\n      qwen_waterfilling_ppl: 12.87\n      qwen_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n      qwen_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap: 14.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Reverse waterfilling 本质上是 continuous relaxation + rounding，\n      在 Llama 这种 sensitivity 分散的模型上，rounding error 较小\n      （因为 head 之间 delta 差异小，rounding 方向影响有限），\n      所以 waterfilling 与 MCKP 差距仅 2.5%。在 Qwen 上差距更大\n      （14.6%），因为 L0 的 extreme sensitivity 导致 rounding 在\n      critical head 上犯错——但这个差距比 constrained vs unconstrained\n      的差距（11.23 vs 36.92）小得多，reviewer 可能认为\n      waterfilling + L0 heuristic 就足够了，不需要完整 MCKP machinery。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Waterfilling vs MCKP\"\n        columns: [model, waterfilling_ppl, constrained_mckp_ppl, gap_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 12.87, 11.23, \"14.6%\"]\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8.52, 8.31, \"2.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: waterfilling vs MCKP across models. Qwen 差距明显，Llama 差距 marginal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 Llama 上 waterfilling 与 MCKP 几乎等效（2.5% gap），\n      削弱了 \"discrete MCKP is fundamentally necessary\" 的 claim。\n      Reviewer 会问：如果只在 GQA 7:1 模型上 MCKP 明显优于 waterfilling，\n      那这是 method contribution 还是 Qwen-specific trick？\n      Reframe: 强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility（能自然嵌入\n      cardinality constraint，waterfilling 不行）。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Brute-Force Subset)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen 的 3-4 layer groups 上做 brute-force 穷举最优分配，\n      量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的差距。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_subset_ppl: 10.41\n      mckp_subset_ppl: 10.78\n      mckp_to_oracle_gap_pct: 3.6\n      oracle_allocation_agrees_with_mckp_pct: 81\n    result_rationale: >\n      在小规模子集上，brute-force oracle 能利用 joint evaluation\n      捕捉 compounding interaction，找到 MCKP additive assumption\n      遗漏的 inter-head synergies。3.6% 的 gap 说明 MCKP 虽然\n      near-optimal 但并非 optimal——additive distortion model\n      即使加了 cardinality constraint 也有 residual error。\n      在 worst 档下，这个 gap 比预期大（理想情况应 <2%），\n      暗示 compounding 的 non-additivity 比 cardinality constraint\n      能 capture 的更复杂（涉及 specific head combinations，\n      不仅仅是 count）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset, Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [method, subset_ppl, gap_to_oracle]\n        rows:\n          - [brute_force_oracle, 10.41, \"0%\"]\n          - [constrained_mckp, 10.78, \"3.6%\"]\n          - [unconstrained_mckp, 14.93, \"43.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Allocation diff heatmap: oracle vs MCKP on subset layers. ~19% heads 被不同分配。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.6% gap 虽然不大但 non-trivial。在 reframed narrative 中，\n      这是 honest limitation：cardinality constraint 是 first-order\n      approximation，full interaction structure 需要更复杂的\n      constraint 设计或 iterative profiling。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      用 C4 calibrate、WikiText-2 evaluate（及反向），报告 per-head\n      allocation 跨 calibration source 的一致率。\n    expected_results:\n      calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl: 12.14\n      calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.23\n      calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl: 16.92\n      calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl: 17.85\n      cross_calib_allocation_agreement_pct: 68\n      l0_robust_across_calib: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration data 影响 per-head delta 估计。C4 calibration 在\n      WikiText-2 上评估时 PPL 12.14（vs 同 domain 的 11.23），\n      degradation 8.1%。反向（wiki calib → C4 eval）degradation 5.5%。\n      Allocation agreement 68% 低于理想（>85%），说明约 1/3 的 heads\n      的最优 bit-width 是 distribution-dependent。\n      L0 protection 跨 calibration 一致（因为 L0 在任何 distribution 上\n      都是 dominant），但 mid-layer 分配不稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Calibration Results (Qwen2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [calibration, eval_dataset, ppl, vs_matched_calib]\n        rows:\n          - [WikiText-2, WikiText-2, 11.23, \"baseline\"]\n          - [C4, WikiText-2, 12.14, \"+8.1%\"]\n          - [C4, C4, 16.92, \"baseline\"]\n          - [WikiText-2, C4, 17.85, \"+5.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap diff: C4-calibrated vs Wiki-calibrated allocation. 差异集中在 mid-layers。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration degradation 是 real concern。Practitioner 需要\n      选择与 deployment distribution 匹配的 calibration data。\n      在 reframed narrative 中，这是 practical limitation 的\n      honest characterization，也是 future work direction。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成 paper-quality figures：per-head delta heatmap、compounding curve、\n      budget allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      key_visual_finding: \"cross-model heatmap comparison dramatically shows architecture-dependent sensitivity\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Visualization 本身不产生新数据，但在 worst 档下，cross-model\n      heatmap 成为 paper 最重要的 figure——直观展示 Qwen (concentrated,\n      L0-dominant) vs Llama/Mistral (dispersed, no single dominant layer)\n      的对比。Compounding curve 只在 Qwen 上有 dramatic elbow，\n      Llama/Mistral 的 curve 相对平坦。这些 visual 恰好 serve\n      reframed narrative。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: 三模型 per-head delta heatmap 横向对比 (3 panels). Qwen 的 L0 spike 非常醒目，Llama/Mistral 分散。\"\n      - \"Figure 2: Compounding effect curves (3 lines on same plot). Qwen hockey stick, Llama/Mistral 近似线性。\"\n      - \"Figure 3: Budget allocation Sankey diagram — bits flow from budget to layers to heads。\"\n      - \"Figure 4: GQA ratio vs sensitivity concentration scatter (3 data points + trend).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Visualization 在 worst 档下反而更有 impact，因为跨模型差异\n      本身就是 visually striking finding。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU/LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下跑 MMLU 和 LongBench，测试 PPL 改进\n      是否 translate to downstream performance。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_fp16_mmlu: 68.2\n      qwen_uniform4bit_mmlu: 64.1\n      qwen_constrained_mmlu: 65.8\n      qwen_mmlu_recovery_pct: 41.5\n      qwen_fp16_longbench_avg: 45.3\n      qwen_uniform4bit_longbench_avg: 38.7\n      qwen_constrained_longbench_avg: 41.2\n      qwen_longbench_recovery_pct: 37.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改进（27%）不会线性 translate 到 downstream tasks。\n      MMLU 是 knowledge-intensive 的 multiple-choice task，\n      quantization 主要影响 calibration（logit precision）而非\n      knowledge recall，所以 recovery 有限（41.5%）。\n      LongBench 涉及 long context，KV cache quantization 对\n      long-range attention 的影响更大，但 constrained MCKP 的\n      per-head allocation 在 long context 下的 optimality\n      可能不同于 short context（profiling 用 2048 tokens），\n      导致 recovery 更低（37.9%）。整体 downstream improvement\n      存在但 modest，不足以成为独立 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Downstream Performance (Qwen2.5-7B, 4×)\"\n        columns: [task, fp16, uniform_4bit, constrained_mckp, recovery_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 68.2, 64.1, 65.8, \"41.5%\"]\n          - [LongBench_avg, 45.3, 38.7, 41.2, \"37.9%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: FP16 / uniform / constrained on MMLU and LongBench.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream results 是 positive but modest。在 worst 档下\n      不足以作为 strong selling point。建议在 paper 中放为\n      supplementary experiment，主叙事仍以 PPL 为核心 metric，\n      downstream 作为 sanity check。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only (Qwen2.5-72B)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上只跑 distortion profiling（不做完整 eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen72b_l0_dominance: true\n      qwen72b_l0_delta_ratio_vs_avg: \"~60× (vs 7B 的 100×)\"\n      qwen72b_nonzero_head_pct: 22\n      qwen72b_sensitivity_concentration: \"5.1% heads cover 70% degradation\"\n      qwen72b_gqa_ratio: \"7:1 (same as 7B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 与 7B 共享 GQA 7:1 架构，所以 L0 dominance 保持（支持\n      GQA-ratio-dependent hypothesis）。但 72B 有 80 layers vs 7B 的 28，\n      更多层分摊了 sensitivity，L0 的 relative dominance 降低\n      （60× vs 100×）。Nonzero head pct 22% 略高于 7B 的 16%，\n      因为更深的 model 有更多层的 heads 对 quantization 有\n      non-trivial sensitivity。但 concentration 仍然高（5.1%），\n      确认 GQA 7:1 架构的 sensitivity 集中特性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Scale Comparison (Qwen Family)\"\n        columns: [model, layers, kv_heads, l0_delta_ratio, nonzero_pct, top_heads_for_70pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B, 28, 112, \"100×\", \"16%\", \"3.6%\"]\n          - [Qwen2.5-72B, 80, 320, \"60×\", \"22%\", \"5.1%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap: 72B (80×4). 与 7B 相同的 L0 spike pattern，但 relative magnitude 较小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B profiling 支持 GQA-ratio-dependent sensitivity hypothesis——\n      同 GQA ratio 的不同 model sizes 有相似但不完全相同的 pattern。\n      在 worst 档下，这是 supporting evidence for reframed narrative，\n      但不足以 claim \"method scales to 70B\" 因为我们没有做完整 eval。\n      作为 paper 的 supplementary evidence 足够。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"43c262b0-4c86-40ed-a43c-7cbed76d8848","total_cost_usd":0.3306655,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10256,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":10213,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10256,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10213,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10256,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10256},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5215,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00531,"contextWindow